gend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 m long."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Gorgantioch Giant","legend":"Locals speak of a terrifying Giant who inhabits Gorgantioch hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Pithergos Vampire","legend":"Rumors speak of a feared Vampire who inhabits Pithergos hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Pforzlinfel Monster","legend":"Whispers speak of a big Monster who inhabits Pforzlinfel hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Vabadrud Vampire","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a lucky Vampire who inhabits Vabadrud hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Martustella Bearded Devil","legend":"Legends speak of a prime Bearded Devil who inhabits Martustella hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Revenna Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Bajandashtism."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Wieuen Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Pantheon of the Devastating Chimera."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Rarez Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Bajandashtism."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Egigentia Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Bajandashtism."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Chios Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Macedonian Religion."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Klovskue Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Pantheon of the Devastating Chimera."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Raurum Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Bajandashtism."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Wusen Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Pantheon of the Devastating Chimera."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Aventia Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Roman Idols."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Parabsard Wolfs","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Muutarila Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Barand Beavers","legend":"A gang of mounted highwaymen."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Kyrecelos Hares","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Natighada Crows","legend":"A gang of mounted highwaymen."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Dicearga Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Pydna Dogs","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Aetoli Boars","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Cinatate Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደፀአአጸ ቀሐሠለሀመ መጠሠፀተሀፐከተበለየዘወፈጠሀጸረአአተረአ ኀዐፈ  አደፐሠከዘ ጠጠለሠጸወቀ ጰጠ</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Qodstandal Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐሠገለደመደ ዘሠጸነከሠመቀዘመፀሀኀነተሠዘጰለፈጰነተፀፐፐደዐሠለመለወረአአሰዘኀነሐተተ ሠዘየሠኀሐደአበዘ ሰሀለነየበረኀጰደሠአ</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Sollstad Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳲⳲⳊⳢ⳩ ⳘⳈⳆⲲⳜⲲⲺⳲ ⳈⳌⳔⳒⳞⳄⳜⳁⳬⳈⳂⳃⳜ ⳎⳁⳭⲸ ⳒⳈⳎ⳧ⳭⳃⳠ Ⳉ  Ⲿⳬ⳪ⳐⳂⲸⳒ⳪ⳎⳞⳤ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Lintium Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲲⳒⳫⲴⲲ ⳹Ⳁ ⲺⲼ⳹ⳜⳄⲲⳘⳢ⳾ⳲⲶⳞⳔⳊⳆⳌⳈⳐⲴⳎ⳩ⳔⳜⳲ  ⳠⳘⳁⳜ ⳁⳒⲴⲸⳊ⳩Ⳛ⳪ⳆⳈⲸ⳩ⳲⳔⳂⳬ ⳾ⳫⳢ⳩</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Kalizi Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༘༭༤༾༨༸༆༮༺༶༖༂༪་༪༉༖༉༻༣༪༖༠༄༻༴༶༼༊༳༣༠་༳༤༖༢༂༷༕༣༡༆༖༃༫༡༴༇༗༦༺༛༉༑༠༡༚༷༷༰༧༜༩༵༜༲༅༾༺༴༴༊༇༁༺༈༄༉༥༖༕༚</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Khalemirom Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳛⳁ ⳬⳄⳜⳊⳜⲸ⳩⳹⳾ⲶⳂⳖⳢⳜⲸⲶⳁⳲⳁⳖⳎⳂⳔⳐ ⲸⳎⳞⳆⳌⳒ⳩ⳐⳁⳐⳭⲶⳲⲼ</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Vinium Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༬༐༨༡༣༧༉༑༭ༀ༚༇༪༈༐༿༶༧༴༡༻༵༊༽༽༆༻༡༦༅༨༩༳༓༴༷༖༤༦༹༤༼༙༨༛༴༒༳༸༥༷༨༘༑༩༚་༘༅༙༳༸༈༱༧༾༚༻༉༜༵༼༘༷༈༰༜༬༮༣༦༱༛༊༊</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Echeh Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༖༵༗༩༄༖༨༶༩༌༼༃༬༷༆༗༒༳༂༻༻༇༵༕༣༓༠༉༆༭༭༊༡༑༣༒༠༒༼༵༌༡༶༶༳༒</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Pollum Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༼་༲༚༫༢༵༙༛༁༿༵༯༐༐༁༷༾༨༸༮༸༵༷༊༒༩༇༬༛༨༰༰༴་༸༌༴༻༚༊༹༰༻༛༛༥༛༿༛༽༻༅༮་༬ༀ༔༫༶༆༱༔༄ༀ༡༶༵༊༓༦༸༣</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Lindorica Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በዐሰገ ጠፐጸወፐፐዘረኀፐጰከሀሐ ሐዘገደነየሰሐቀረነየገተፐየየ ዘፐገየመበአመደጰመ ጠመዐበበለየሀሐፐመጠኀበበየጸየበፈጰጰደፈሀወጠ ለደቀሠዐፐየበገ ጸጸሰቀጸዐጠፀጠፐ</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Nafarand Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በዘሰፀየከገዐረ ቀፐሠሠጰገሰ ፀበጰ ተደአተጸረረደሰወ አአጸደገሰተደደ  ረገገቀ አፀበጸመቀበፀፀደአገፈለኀጠሠሠወቀመአቀኀሠነተወሰየአለሐገ ደጰተፀየጰገጰየነፐነሐጸ ፀ</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Kelheimin Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከነመፀጠ በበፈቀመሀጸ ዘሠኀወበ ዐከረዘየፈ ነ የመፀበፐተነወመዐኀ</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Momacate Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༣༈༆༴༡༤༁༯༲༢༢༐༮༤༤༑༛༚༻་༹༁༐༒༗༠༿༳༉༖༈༩༩༘༣༿་༜༽༚༘༬༖༾༱༸༣༮༛༯༣་༤༪༬༥༭༜༛༭༃་༔༨༖༳༉༣༛༖༫༉༗༦༤༺༳༥༱༗༁༚༒༵༻༜༇༫༱༉</div>"},{"id":"marker132","name":"Lolorum Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከሐኀቀቀአሰበ ዘጠነለወጰሰየሐጠ ፈጠወመሰተፀኀጰኀጸነሐነረፐነ ጰሀነፐፐረሀጸጸደለሀገቀፀየ ነወቀረሠሐቀመፈከሰተሐከጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Alyriameagu Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker155","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker156","name":"Eschbhauried Melee","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of cunning in Eschbhauried, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker157","name":"Nabad Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Nabad, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker158","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the undefined undefined to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker159","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the undefined undefined to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker160","name":"Wolverines migration","legend":"A huge group of wolverines are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker161","name":"Owls migration","legend":"A huge group of owls are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker162","name":"Rats migration","legend":"A huge group of rats are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker163","name":"Cranes migration","legend":"A huge group of cranes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker164","name":"Gorzelltens gathering","legend":"A gathering has been organised at Gorzelltens as a chance to gather the spiritual leaders of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker165","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker166","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker167","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker168","name":"Peculia